<title>USA: U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review -- June 20.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review -- June 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>National Sunflower Summary -- USDA Market News Service Prices as of June 20, 1997</p>
<p>Weekly Trends: Sunflower Seeds were mostly 15 cents lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Meal was 3.00 to 15.00 lower, mostly 10.00 to 15.00 lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Oil was steady to 50 points lower.</p>
